# ============================================================================
# 3. ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS
# ============================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
*.pem
# rsh-c1fm: the release-signing PUBLIC key is intentionally committed (it is
# already embedded in every binary; build.rs embeds it on hosts lacking the
# workstation S:/ path). Private keys (*.pem above) stay ignored.
!crates/mrsh-core/release-pubkey.pub.pem
*.key
*.crt
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
secrets/
**/secrets/**
**/credentials/**
**/*.secret
**/*.credentials
!**/secrets/README.md
!**/credentials/README.md

